  "description": "SOEM包装器,用于win和linux控制EtherCat设备,目前只支持COE和IO从站增加1.0.8版本之前不支持CSP CSV CST模式,在linux中自动启用1000us周期PDO读写,(暂时不支持DC同步,等待后续开发)如果不需要周期PDO读写请使用1.0.8版本\nSOEM wrapper, used for controlling EtherCat devices on Windows and Linux, currently only supports COE and IO slaves,Before the 1.0.8 version was added, the CSP CSV CST mode was not supported, and the 1000us cycle PDO read/write was automatically enabled in Linux (DC synchronization is not supported temporarily, waiting for subsequent development)Use version 1.0.8 if not required.",
